      {
        "heading": "Who are the main buyers and contractors in this NAICS?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs is the largest buyer at $771M in FY2026 to date. The Department of Defense obligated $61.8M and the Department of Health and Human Services obligated $53.9M. SDV OFFICE SYSTEMS LLC, FIRST NATION GROUP LLC, and OLYMPUS AMERICA INC are the top three vendors at $148M, $98M, and $83.7M respectively."
